{
  "$comment": [
    "pure profile：只掛宿主自帶的層，不裝任何第三方或自研插件。",
    "用途：診斷「這是 DSH 的問題還是插件的問題」；升級前的基準；新機器先驗引擎。",
    "與 profiles/web 共用同一個編譯器（derive-profile.mjs --profile pure）。"
  ],
  "profileName": "dsh-profile-pure",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@10.14.0",
  "patchReload": "live",
  "$comment_runtime": [
    "runtime 是這份 profile 瞄準的宿主世代。pure 沒有外部依賴，所以它同時是「引擎能不能自己跑起來」的基準。"
  ],
  "runtime": "0.2.2-rc.1",
  "hostBundles": [
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-agent-team-profile",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-terminal-bundle"
  ],
  "npm": {},
  "github": {},
  "local": {},
  "derivedOverridesFrom": [],
  "buildDeps": [],
  "aggregates": {},
  "bundleOrder": [
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-terminal-bundle",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-agent-team-profile"
  ]
}
